                            <comment id="497078" author="emoly.liu" created="Tue, 30 Jun 2026 09:50:17 +0000">&lt;p&gt;This "migrate -m 1,3 failed" only happens on ZFS, due to the following error on MDT&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;[ 9836.014274] LustreError: 560087:0:(fld_handler.c:219:fld_local_lookup()) srv-lustre-MDT0000: FLD cache range [0x0000000240000400-0x0000000280000400]:1:mdt does not match requested flag ff20f381: rc = -5
[ 9836.014444] LustreError: 560087:0:(fld_handler.c:267:fld_server_lookup()) srv-lustre-MDT0000: Cannot find sequence 0x240001b71: rc = -2
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flag ff20f381 is not valid.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
